  "details": "This feature would allow world creators to designate specific VRChat groups as the \"Official\" representation of their world. Instances hosted by these groups would be prioritized in the instance list, making them the recommended option for players to join. \n\nThis can benefit larger worlds a lot since there can be some \"bad egg\" group instances that either skirt along the lines of or completely go against the rules of the world they are in, therefore potentially giving new players a bad first impression.",
